      "script": [
        {
          "say": "要开小艇啦。我们试着只听声音，在图里找玩具。"
        },
        {
          "spotlight": "picture"
        },
        {
          "say": "Point to the blue dog."
        },
        {
          "say": "Point to the green cat."
        },
        {
          "say": "Find the blue bird."
        },
        {
          "say": "Find the yellow bird."
        },
        {
          "say": "Find the green dog."
        },
        {
          "say": "Find the red cat."
        },
        {
          "say": "Look for the blue dog."
        },
        {
          "say": "Look for the green cat."
        },
        {
          "say": "Look for the yellow bird."
        },
        {
          "spotlight": "caption"
        },
        {
          "say": "再听颜色和动物，少听一个就会找错。"
        },
        {
          "say": "如果图卡亮起，就把小船移到它下面。"
        },
        {
          "say": "颜色和动物都听清，就能找到对应的图。"
        }
      ]
    },
