    {
      "key": "count-by-ear",
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "听拍手，再说几个",
      "template": "two-columns",
      "data": {
        "title": "听拍手，再说几个",
        "left": {
          "heading": "先用耳朵听",
          "body": "How many?"
        },
        "left_picture": "clapping-hands",
        "right": {
          "heading": "再找要数的物件",
          "body": "Three balls."
        },
        "right_picture": "counting-panel"
      },
      "script": [
        {
          "say": "谁会不用眼睛数？先看这双手，等会儿只用耳朵听。"
        },
        {
          "spotlight": "left-picture"
        },
        {
          "say": "Count the claps."
        },
        {
          "say": "假如拍了三下，我跟着数 one, two, three。拍完答 Three。"
        },
        {
          "say": "How many?"
        },
        {
          "say": "等会儿你可以点拍手图标听，也能再听一遍。"
        },
        {
          "spotlight": "right-picture"
        },
        {
          "say": "也可以看图数。老师问 balls，就只数圆圆的球。"
        },
        {
          "say": "How many balls?"
        },
        {
          "say": "Three balls."
        },
        {
          "say": "旁边有一本书，但书和球不是一种物件，不数进去。"
        },
        {
          "say": "One, two, three, four."
        },
        {
          "say": "Five, six, seven."
        },
        {
          "say": "Eight, nine, ten."
        },
        {
          "say": "请家人拍几下。先别看，听完再用英语说数。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "guess-after-clues",
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "先猜，再听答复",
